      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0103-27e854bd1855</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;1975&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"YEAR"</data>
      <data key="d1">"1975 is the year when Barbra Streisand's album 'Lazy Afternoon' was released and when she began working on the project after the 'Funny Lady' soundtrack."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0103-27e854bd1855</data>
    </node>
